@startuml
title RF43 — Mini campo 3D no intervalo · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "MatchSimulator" as MatchSimulator
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
Frontend -> API: GET /matches/{mid}
API -> UseCase: MatchQueryUseCases.state(mid, userId)
UseCase -> Redis: LiveMatchStatePort: 11 por lado, fadiga, down, ballOnAbsYd
UseCase -> MySQL: MatchSession (fallback) · Uniform e HelmetDesign fixados
API --> Frontend: 200 MatchStateDto
Frontend -> API: GET /clubs/{cid}/playbook
API --> Frontend: jogadas com diagrama
Frontend -> Frontend: buildTacticalFieldSnapshot · layoutFormation(formação × pacote) · avatarFor
Frontend -> Frontend: navegador: WebGL? primeiros quadros? PerformanceMonitor
alt sem WebGL
  Frontend -> Manager: MiniField2D equivalente
else WebGL
  Frontend -> Manager: MiniField3D com 22 atletas, rotas e zonas
end
Manager -> Frontend: troca no depth chart + ênfase de jogadas
Frontend -> API: POST /matches/{mid}/decisions [{DEPTH_SWAP…}, {GAME_PLAN…}] (snapshotVersion)
API -> UseCase: AdvanceMatchUseCase.decisions
UseCase -> MatchSimulator: validateDecisions(lote) — tudo ou nada
alt lote inválido
  UseCase --> API: DecisionRejected{code}
  API --> Frontend: 409 {code, message}
else senão
  UseCase -> Redis: estado atualizado (version + 1)
  UseCase -> MySQL: MatchSession.snapshotJson · decisionsLog
  API --> Frontend: 200
  Frontend -> API: POST /matches/{mid}/advance
  API --> Frontend: 200 (LIVE, próximo quarto)
end
@enduml
